# Two Federation destroyers on layouts/emitters.jsonc: Venting starts with its engines and life support destroyed, so its
# plasma and steam damage emitters spray; Intact is undamaged. The dump names the damage nodes each model shows; the
# shots, a fraction of a second apart, show the spray build up.
# Run it with --layout layouts/emitters.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
scroll up 20
wait 0.3
shot spray-1
dump d1
wait 0.5
shot spray-2
wait 0.5
shot spray-3
wait 1.5
shot spray-4
dump d2
